  designNotes: 'The user, 2026-10-16: a creature still deploying of yours comes in
    up to 2 Days sooner, and pays for it with Burnout: it''s destroyed at the end
    of the first Day it''s ready, so it gets that one Day to act. A Cleanse saves
    it. Corporate''s tempo: a big body now, for one Day.'
  artDescription: An office worker at a desk late at night, surrounded by empty coffee
    cups and energy drink cans, typing furiously with smoke rising from the keyboard,
    eyes bloodshot and wide open, a wall clock showing 3 a.m. and a calendar with
    every weekend crossed out.
